{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/pulls/1","id":3681857314,"node_id":"PR_kwDOR6T3i87bdK8i","html_url":"https://github.com/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/pull/1.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/issues/1","number":1,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: dispatch dashboard, ETA tracking, autopilot auto-complete, fast-path cancel","user":{"login":"vickky06","id":51980219,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTgwMjE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51980219?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06","html_url":"https://github.com/vickky06","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## **User description**\nfeat: dispatch dashboard, ETA tracking, autopilot auto-complete, fast-path cancel\n\n- GetAllStates: snapshot of every trip's state for the dispatch dashboard\n  to render near-real-time tiles without blocking per-trip writers.\n- ETA streamer: spawn a per-trip goroutine on AssignDriver to publish\n  estimated pickup time at 15s cadence. Terminates by GC pressure after\n  the closure becomes unreachable.\n- Autopilot auto-complete: when an AUTOPILOT trip enters InProgress, the\n  state machine drives it straight to Completed via the new Service\n  callback (no separate driver complete event needed).\n- Cancel(): fast cancel-then-cleanup path; reads the trip under RLock so\n  multiple cancels for different trips can run in parallel.\n\n\n___\n\n## **CodeAnt-AI Description**\n**Show live trip snapshots, ETA updates, autopilot auto-complete, and faster trip canceling**\n\n### What Changed\n- The dispatch dashboard can now load a snapshot of every trip’s current state at once, so it can show live trip tiles without waiting on each trip individually.\n- After a driver is assigned, trips now keep publishing ETA updates, which helps keep pickup times visible on the dashboard.\n- AUTOPILOT trips now complete on their own once they enter `InProgress`, so they no longer need a separate completion step.\n- Canceling a trip now ends it immediately and removes it from the active trip list, so canceled trips disappear from the dashboard right away.\n\n### Impact\n`✅ Live dispatch tiles`\n`✅ Fewer missed autopilot completions`\n`✅ Faster trip cancellation`\n\n\n[🔄 Retrigger CodeAnt AI Review](https://api.codeant.ai/pr/retrigger_review?id=Xno4zehoRkEI9CrDcAUFpnmfMUyZr3PMB7Ro7xSt3b0&org=vickky06)<details><summary><strong>💡 Usage Guide</strong></summary>\n\n### Checking Your Pull Request\nEvery time you make a pull request, our system automatically looks through it. We check for security issues, mistakes in how you're setting up your infrastructure, and common code problems. We do this to make sure your changes are solid and won't cause any trouble later.\n\n### Talking to CodeAnt AI\nGot a question or need a hand with something in your pull request? You can easily get in touch with CodeAnt AI right here. Just type the following in a comment on your pull request, and replace \"Your question here\" with whatever you want to ask:\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai ask: Your question here</code>\n</pre>\nThis lets you have a chat with CodeAnt AI about your pull request, making it easier to understand and improve your code.\n\n#### Example\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai ask: Can you suggest a safer alternative to storing this secret?</code>\n</pre>\n\n### Preserve Org Learnings with CodeAnt\nYou can record team preferences so CodeAnt AI applies them in future reviews. Reply directly to the specific CodeAnt AI suggestion (in the same thread) and replace \"Your feedback here\" with your input:\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai: Your feedback here</code>\n</pre>\nThis helps CodeAnt AI learn and adapt to your team's coding style and standards.\n\n#### Example\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai: Do not flag unused imports.</code>\n</pre>\n\n### Retrigger review\nAsk CodeAnt AI to review the PR again, by typing:\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai: review</code>\n</pre>\n\n### Check Your Repository Health\nTo analyze the health of your code repository, visit our dashboard at [https://app.codeant.ai](https://app.codeant.ai). This tool helps you identify potential issues and areas for improvement in your codebase, ensuring your repository maintains high standards of code health.\n\n</details>\n","created_at":"2026-05-14T09:17:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T09:41:42Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"08d37fc810e0b4d6b6c95f890e5e2da17ab76ab6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":10949965943,"node_id":"LA_kwDOR6T3i88AAAACjKs4dw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/labels/size:L","name":"size:L","color":"bfd4f2","default":false,"description":"This PR changes 100-499 lines, ignoring generated files"}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Ride-Sharing-Trip-Manager/pulls/comments{/number}","com